                "reorganizing them when the", "air suddenly felt...charged,", "out of nowhere? There was",
                "this weird fizzy feeling in my", "my mouth through the entire", "place.\"",
                "The ginger-haired girl", "waggled her fingers as if", "sprinkling an invisible",
                "seasoning over the candies.", "Reimu tilted her head", "questioningly. Situations",
                "where the air itself was off", "were unfamiliar to her; she'd", "experienced a weird",
                "haze once in the anoxic", "depths of that rainbow-hued", "cave in the recent market",
                "incident, but what Kosuzu", "described didn't sound", "similar in any way.", "",
                "\"After that, I went outside", "to see if there was just some", "weird dust or something in",
                "the room, but when I looked", "out, I saw the craziest sight!", "There was glowing,",
                "orangey-red energy flowing in", "waves across the entire", "village!\"", "",
                "Interest piqued, Reimu sat up", "straighter, all traces of", "tiredness from earlier now",
                "melted away.", "Orangey-red energy? she", "thought. The entire village?", "",
                "\"And then, when a few kids", "that were running around", "playing reached out to touch",
                "it, there was a bright flash!\"", "Kosuzu shot up with her arms", "stretched out like the Sun's",
                "rays, then flopped back down", "to the shrine's floor.", "Reimu was fully alert now.", "",
                "\"More and more people began", "reaching out for the waves of", "energy, and after the same",
                "lights flashed again, more", "strange things were", "happening!", "One man was moving water,",
                "another woman creating ice", "a little girl growing plants", "just by touching them, and",
                "so many more across the", "village! There was chaos", "everywhere!\"", "",
                "If the librarian's eyes", "could get any brighter, Reimu", "would have thought them",
                "stars in the night sky. The", "shrine maiden didn't have to", "hear the words that rested on",
                "her lips to know what she", "would say next:", "", "\"This has to be an incident!\"", "",
                "For a brief moment, Kozusu's", "infectious excitement", "overwhelmed Reimu; the idea",
