                "Reimu pocketed the swirly", "bottle (\"Hey, that's mine!\")", "and quickly made for the",
                "veranda, an unusually", "serious expression dawning", "on her face.", "",
                "\"I'm heading to the village,", "my intuition's pointing that", "way!\"", "",
                "Gohei in hand, the shrine", "maiden of paradise readied", "herself and, with a burst of",
                "speed, flew off over the", "Forest of Magic, leaving a", "windblown Kosuzu and Marisa",
                "behind with the (devoured)", "remains of their tea party.", "---------------------------------------",
                "\"Can you believe it? New", "abilities in Gensokyo?\"", "", "The black-white magician",
                "excitedly spouted out her", "thoughts to Kosuzu, the stars", "in her eyes larger than the",
                "ones the librarian had seen", "her fire in battle.", "", "\"Marisa, did Miss Reimu seem",
                "really...serious, to you?\"", "", "The librarian anxiously", "twisted her auburn curls,",
                "obviously troubled by the", "sudden turn of events.", "\"I've never seen her like that",
                "before, other than when she", "chased that jinyou out of the", "village a while ago.\"", "",
                "The magician brushed her", "golden locks out of her", "eyes and rested her head in",
                "her hands, pondering the", "question; her gaze betrayed", "the mountain of thoughts",
                "behind it.", "", "\"Well...I was thinking...\"", "", "\"Huh?\"", "",
                "Marisa met Kosuzu's", "inquisitive expression.", "\"...if I just got my magic out of",
                "nowhere, with no training or", "nothin', I probably wouldn't", "have any idea how to use it,",
                "right?\"", "", "\"That makes sense...\"", "", "\"So, if a whole buncha",
                "villagers without any magic", "suddenly got abilities,", "whaddoyou think would",
