                "Go, fair shrine maiden of", "fantasy! Uncover the mystery", "behind the primeval",
                "gift-giving energy and bring", "back balance to Gensokyo!", "",
                "Girls are praying for", "your safety..."
        ];
    }
    case(INDEX_REIMU){
        path = ["The all-too-familiar Hakurei", "Shrine maiden that protects", "Gensokyo from youkai",
                "activity and yet is beloved by", "them all the same.", "As the one who maintains",
